<title>INDIA: India's IDBI 1996/97 results on June 5.</title>
<headline>India's IDBI 1996/97 results on June 5.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industrial Development Bank of India (IDBI) on Wednesday said its board will meet on Thursday to announce financial results for the year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The results will be announced around 1530 hours, it said.</p>
<p>IDBI is India's largest term lending bank.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
